## This lemma: leaf 5. Upgrade `NK.NeukirchUchida.nonempty_mulEquiv_decompositionGroupOf_localGalois` (an abstract ≃*) to a homeomorphism: the map is restriction of automorphisms to the (dense) image of K' in the completion; continuity both ways from the Krull topologies (open subgroups ↔ finite extensions, Krasner). Note `Submission.NeukirchUchida.decompositionGroup` vs `NK.Mine.decompositionGroupOf` — show they agree.
